# f1 = feed, f6 = inc
# -- source: a-copy-in-line-leaves-for-its-call-under-the-cleanup-of-a-for-of.ts
# // A method copied in line inside a for-of: where a guess of the copy fails it leaves for the call; what the call throws must still close an iterator that goes by protocol, once, and a list needs no closing.
